{"mode":"training","language":"en","altTextLanguage":"","title":"","instruction":{"english":"","german":""},"allowInstructionLineBreaks":false,"readingText":{"instruction":{"german":"","english":""},"content":"","configs":[]},"sequences":[{"instruction":{"german":"<p>Read the information in the box.<\/p>","english":""},"configs":[],"staticConfigs":[],"parts":["<p><br><\/p>"],"globalTypesConfigs":[{"type":"gap","widthMode":"adaptToContent","longestAlternativeSolutions":false,"ignoreCaseSensitivity":false}],"staticText":{"text":"<p><b>Build your potential | Using <em>because<\/em> and <em>so<\/em><\/b><\/p><p><b><em>\ufeff<\/em><\/b>When we make guesses, we often want to give reasons.<\/p><p>We can use the linking words <em>because<\/em> and <em>so<\/em> to give reasons for our guesses.<\/p><p>\u2022 We use <em>because<\/em> to explain the reason for something.<\/p><p>\u2022 We use <em>so<\/em> to explain something.<\/p><p><b>Result  <\/b><em>I think this is probably an important game<\/em><\/p><p><b>Reason <em>because<\/em><\/b><em> they aren\u2019t smiling.<\/em><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><b>Reason  <\/b><em>They aren\u2019t smiling, <\/em><\/p><p><b>Result <em>so<\/em><\/b><em> I think this is probably an important game.<\/em><\/p>","backgroundColor":"rgba(173,251,229,0.22)","isSet":true}},{"instruction":{"english":"","german":"<p>Now complete the sentences with <em>because<\/em> or <em>so<\/em>.<\/p>"},"parts":["<p><b>1<\/b> He\u2019s running very fast <gap id=\"gap_0\"><\/gap> he wants to win the race.<\/p><p><b>2<\/b> I love swimming, <gap id=\"gap_3\"><\/gap> I go to the swimming pool three times a week.<\/p><p><b>3<\/b> I think they\u2019re brother and sister <gap id=\"gap_1\"><\/gap> they have the same colour hair.<\/p><p><b>4<\/b> I think perhaps their team is losing <gap id=\"gap_2\"><\/gap> they look very sad.<\/p><p><b>5<\/b> There are lots of people watching the game, <gap id=\"gap_4\"><\/gap> perhaps it\u2019s an important match.<\/p>"],"configs":[{"correctAns